    {
      "msgid": "characteristicsPanel/specialInfo/boss",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "[Alpha and Omega] The Blitzträger boasts impressive armament and teleportation technology, and is almost indestructible when its shield is up. It also serves as a powerful platform for accessing a devastating weapon system: Hyperion.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "characteristicsPanel/specialInfo/hunter_1",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "[Brawler] A good generalist at close range.\nThe vehicle can cause high damage to groups of Sentinels and repair itself between skirmishes.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "characteristicsPanel/specialInfo/hunter_2",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "[Juggernaut] A good assault vehicle against Sentinels.\nIt can cause serious burst damage to the Blitzträger or Sentinels and has thick armor, but needs to plan how to engage enemies.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "characteristicsPanel/specialInfo/hunter_3",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "[Hit and Run] A fast agitator to outmaneuver the Blitzträger.\nThe vehicle lacks power against Sentinels but compensates with hit-and-run tactics using speed and a temporary shield against the slow Blitzträger.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "characteristicsPanel/specialInfo/hunter_4",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "[Sniping Support] A guardian angel at medium to long range.\nThe vehicle can cause massive amounts of damage to targets from afar, but lacks the means to engage them close up.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "crewPanel/role/boss",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "The Creator",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "crewPanel/role/hunter_1",
