    {
      "msgid": "welcomeScreen/description_1",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Von Krieger has built a thinking machine he calls the Electric Intelligence. It hides where our guns cannot reach. Every shot we fire becomes its lesson. But we are not finished teaching.",
